# ── 换行符统一 LF，避免鸿蒙工具链在 CRLF 下解析失败 ──
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.uts text eol=lf
*.uvue text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.json5 text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# ── 二进制，禁止行尾转换 ──
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary

# ── 签名与证书实体：即使误 add 也无法入库 ──
*.p12 binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.p7b binary
*.cer binary
*.mobileprovision binary

# 提示词文档 linguist 统计：视作文档而非代码
docs/prompts/*.md linguist-documentation
